# investigate_weird_vape — "Investigate the Weird Vape" (Quest 4, part 1 of 2)
#
# The owner's "Quest 4" is two engine quests, because a dialogue choice cannot hand over an item —
# only a quest REWARD can. Daniel's Big Blue is that reward, so the brewing arc ends HERE and the
# delivery is deliver_the_big_blue.quest.
#
# GRANTED BY: Daniel Pauls at the end of Check Out the Church (quests/dialogue/danielpauls.quest,
# node cotc_scrapman).
# COMPLETED BY: Daniel's brew choice (danielpauls.quest, node iwv_deliver), which also grants
# deliver_the_big_blue. The reward — the Big Blue — is paid on that completion.
#
# ⚠ NEW ITEM IDS the owner is building. Each ItemData.ItemID must match exactly or the import
# errors: blueberries, vending_machine_fungus, bus_station_barnacles, big_blue (reward), and
# makeshift_vape (carried in from Quest 3, shown to Scrap Man).
# ⚠ NEW KEYS: scrapman (QuestActor + Preset_Scrapman ✓), bus_station_neek (Kill targets in the old
# bus station chunk — author them in ONE chunk, per QUESTS_AND_DIALOGUE.md).

QUEST investigate_weird_vape
TITLE: Investigate the Weird Vape
GIVER: Daniel Pauls
LOCATION: Scrap Man's place, southeast of London.

# Stage 0 — Scrap Man eyes the makeshift vape and asks for a "Big Blue". Intermediate TalkTo:
# advances on the interact, which is fine — it is not the final stage and carries no hand-in.
STAGE TALKTO scrapman
OBJECTIVE: Take the makeshift vape to Scrap Man, southeast of London.

# Stage 1 — Daniel hears the price and sends you to the old bus station for the ingredients.
STAGE TALKTO danielpauls
OBJECTIVE: Scrap Man wants a "Big Blue". Ask Daniel Paul about it.

# Stage 2 — clear the bus station first. Kill targets must live in one chunk (respawns re-arm the
# count on a crossing — QUESTS_AND_DIALOGUE.md).
STAGE KILL bus_station_neek x3
OBJECTIVE: Clear the Neeks out of the old bus station.

# Stage 3 (last) — the multi-item gather. The objective flips to WHENMET only once ALL THREE are
# carried (QuestStage.AlsoCollect). The hand-in is Daniel's dialogue; a Collect stage never
# completes the quest itself.
STAGE COLLECT blueberries x2 vending_machine_fungus x2 bus_station_barnacles x2
OBJECTIVE: Gather the goods from the old bus station: 2 blueberries, 2 vending machine fungus and 2 bus station barnacles.
WHENMET: Head back to Daniel Paul to combine them.

# The reward IS the Big Blue — Daniel brews it and it lands in the bag on completion. The three
# ingredients are NOT consumed (a dialogue choice can only consume one item); Daniel combines them
# narratively. Change this if they should vanish.
REWARD
ITEM: big_blue x1
